905 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Generally, for the purpose of this book, we have identified seven streams of wisdom. We chose seven streams because there always seems to be something remarkable about giving seven points on something that amazes people. The truth is that there are seven variants of words in the Hebrew rendition of the Book of Proverb that are translated to mean wisdom; understanding, knowledge, discretion and other related words that show acumen. Proverbs 9:1 says, Wisdom has built her house; she has carved its seven columns. There are seven operations of the Spirit of God \(Isaiah 11:2\), and the Book of Revelation is replete with seven churches, seven candlesticks, seven stars, seven seals, seven trumpets, seven eyes and seven other things. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
