917 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (     6. Entrepreneurial or Business Wisdom: Enterprise and ability to build a profitable system is a measure of wisdom. Most believers have not come to terms with the importance of business wisdom; the ability to make the best financial and profit-oriented decision for continuity and sustainability of an enterprise. The wisdom of buying and selling, capitalizing on opportunities, building wealth and generating income, dealing with people with shrewd sense is called business wisdom. Business wisdom, most times, is practical wisdom in the business scene. It is not always developed in business school. According to 1 Kings 10:4-5, And when the queen of Sheba had seen all the wisdom of Solomon, the house that he had built, 5 the food on his table, the seating of his servants, the service of his waiters and their apparel, his cupbearers, and his entryway by which he went up to the house of the Lord, there was no more spirit in her. Solomon manifested business and organisational wisdom in addition to all the other streams of wisdom that he had.      7. Skill/Technical Wisdom: There is a dimension of wisdom that shows itself as creativity, skill and ability to do things with aptitude and proficiency. Wisdom in that area of skill is usually as a result of God given grace and love for that field.)
/E (     6. Entrepreneurial or Business Wisdom: Enterprise and ability to build a profitable system is a measure of wisdom. Most believers have not come to terms with the importance of business wisdom; the ability to make the best financial and profit-oriented decision for continuity and sustainability of an enterprise. The wisdom of buying and selling, capitalizing on opportunities, building wealth and generating income, dealing with people with shrewd sense is called business wisdom. Business wisdom, most times, is practical wisdom in the business scene. It is not always developed in business school. According to 1 Kings 10:4-5, And when the queen of Sheba had seen all the wisdom of Solomon, the house that he had built, 5 the food on his table, the seating of his servants, the service of his waiters and their apparel, his cupbearers, and his entryway by which he went up to the house of the Lord, there was no more spirit in her. Solomon manifested business and organisational wisdom in addition to all the other streams of wisdom that he had.      7. Skill/Technical Wisdom: There is a dimension of wisdom that shows itself as creativity, skill and ability to do things with aptitude and proficiency. Wisdom in that area of skill is usually as a result of God given grace and love for that field.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
918 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Ex 31:1-6 says, The Lord also said to Moses, "See, I have appointed Bezalel \(son of Uri, and grandson of Hur, of the tribe of Judah\), and have filled him with the Spirit of God, giving him great wisdom, ability, and skill in constructing the Tabernacle and everything it contains. He is highly capable as an artistic designer of objects made of gold, silver, and bronze. He is skilled, too, as a jeweler and in carving wood. "And I have appointed Oholiab \(son of Ahisamach of the tribe of Dan\) to be his assistant; moreover, I have given special skill to all who are known as experts, so that they can make all the things I have instructed you to make. \(TLB\). Tech savviness, musical dexterity, unmatched sport prowess, artistic finesse and mastery, and technical knack are often expressions of wisdom in a specific area. )
/E (Ex 31:1-6 says, The Lord also said to Moses, "See, I have appointed Bezalel \(son of Uri, and grandson of Hur, of the tribe of Judah\), and have filled him with the Spirit of God, giving him great wisdom, ability, and skill in constructing the Tabernacle and everything it contains. He is highly capable as an artistic designer of objects made of gold, silver, and bronze. He is skilled, too, as a jeweler and in carving wood. "And I have appointed Oholiab \(son of Ahisamach of the tribe of Dan\) to be his assistant; moreover, I have given special skill to all who are known as experts, so that they can make all the things I have instructed you to make. \(TLB\). Tech savviness, musical dexterity, unmatched sport prowess, artistic finesse and mastery, and technical knack are often expressions of wisdom in a specific area. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
