942 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Living an unappraised life is great folly. Periodic evaluation and routine check-up of every area of your life is great wisdom. Many people do things repeatedly without even pausing to check whether they are getting the intended results from doing those things. It is commonly said that doing the same thing repeatedly and expecting a different result is folly. Well, living an unappraised life is what makes people continue doing things without reconsideration. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
