949 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Apart from daily self-evaluation, there should also be times when you take time off from the hustle-bustle of life just for the purpose of a more robust and intensive self-appraisal. In this period, you take a look at the life goals that you have set before now, inspect them and see where you have performed poorly in all honesty, then make those areas a priority going forward. An unexamined life is a life pre-disposable to error. Engage the Wisdom of Self-Examination today.)
/E (Apart from daily self-evaluation, there should also be times when you take time off from the hustle-bustle of life just for the purpose of a more robust and intensive self-appraisal. In this period, you take a look at the life goals that you have set before now, inspect them and see where you have performed poorly in all honesty, then make those areas a priority going forward. An unexamined life is a life pre-disposable to error. Engage the Wisdom of Self-Examination today.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
