965 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Greatness is a cumulus of simple but consistent routines that develop over time. The most valid factor to vet greatness is to check the track record of the routines that led to it. Automated routine is the genius of greatness. Wise and exceptional people have learnt the secret of automating the routines that account for their success in life.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
966 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Most people do great things here and there. Nearly everybody works out once in a while, reads a good book, takes a daring step to move forward when they are pressured by life, or creatively solves problems as the occasion presents. However, the difference between exceptional people and average people is that great people consistently do the great things that average people do once in a while.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
