973 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The signature of the wisdom of automation is seen everywhere in nature. Since God created the first fruit and herb, He has never had to revisit to create another. He automated a system for reproduction in all living things. Thus Genesis 8:22 says, "While the earth remaineth, seedtime and harvest, and cold and heat, and summer and winter, and day and night shall not cease.")
/E (The signature of the wisdom of automation is seen everywhere in nature. Since God created the first fruit and herb, He has never had to revisit to create another. He automated a system for reproduction in all living things. Thus Genesis 8:22 says, "While the earth remaineth, seedtime and harvest, and cold and heat, and summer and winter, and day and night shall not cease.")
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
974 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The Law of Automation is the master key to consistency and commitment. When there is an automated routine that you live up to, your life performance is not left to mood or chance. Many people are largely regulated by emotions which vacillate irregularly. So, a person makes a decision for greatness and draws out goals and disciplines he needs to pursue and get fulfilled. But, at the very next moment, he has wandered off the goal and suddenly becomes so indifferent to the pursuit of the goals he had set. Why? It is because he is being regulated by situations, emotions and emergencies of life. It is wise for your life to be regulated by routines and systems. )
/E (The Law of Automation is the master key to consistency and commitment. When there is an automated routine that you live up to, your life performance is not left to mood or chance. Many people are largely regulated by emotions which vacillate irregularly. So, a person makes a decision for greatness and draws out goals and disciplines he needs to pursue and get fulfilled. But, at the very next moment, he has wandered off the goal and suddenly becomes so indifferent to the pursuit of the goals he had set. Why? It is because he is being regulated by situations, emotions and emergencies of life. It is wise for your life to be regulated by routines and systems. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
