1000 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Order is doing the right thing at the right time in the right place. Order is the harbinger of excellence. In fact, excellence has been defined as attaining the highest level of order in a particular venture. Order is paying attention to details and making sure everything is as it ought to be. An orderly life is the requirement for growth, greatness and productivity. Anything that is out of order saps energy and waste effort. You must make sure you live an ordered life.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1001 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 33 0 R
