1013 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (1 Tim 3:2 says, for a pastor must be a good man whose life cannot be spoken against. He must have only one wife, and he must be hard working and thoughtful, ORDERLY, and full of good deeds. . . \(TLB\) A leader must be orderly in conduct and behaviour. An unruly conduct and conversation is the foolishness of disorder. Behave orderly and speak like a gentleman and lady with sound etiquette. Another area where order cannot be overlooked is in dressing. Going through the Bible, we see that God is specific about dressing for His people. Indecent and immoral dressing is wrong by all ramifications and is disorderly for a leader, most especially a Christian. )
/E (1 Tim 3:2 says, for a pastor must be a good man whose life cannot be spoken against. He must have only one wife, and he must be hard working and thoughtful, ORDERLY, and full of good deeds. . . \(TLB\) A leader must be orderly in conduct and behaviour. An unruly conduct and conversation is the foolishness of disorder. Behave orderly and speak like a gentleman and lady with sound etiquette. Another area where order cannot be overlooked is in dressing. Going through the Bible, we see that God is specific about dressing for His people. Indecent and immoral dressing is wrong by all ramifications and is disorderly for a leader, most especially a Christian. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
