/T (The level of order in your personal life dictates the order in your organization and work. Do you know that order that you develop in your personal hygiene and grooming, home and office arrangement, and general daily life will spill over to your work, career, enterprise and business. Every organization and platform generally assumes the level of order demonstrated by its members, especially the leader\(s\).)
/E (The level of order in your personal life dictates the order in your organization and work. Do you know that order that you develop in your personal hygiene and grooming, home and office arrangement, and general daily life will spill over to your work, career, enterprise and business. Every organization and platform generally assumes the level of order demonstrated by its members, especially the leader\(s\).)
