1022 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (There is proper order in communication lines in an organization. There is due order in business communication and it is different from informal conversation. There is a right order in relating with the opposite gender, There is also due order in ministry as regards relating with the people and resources God commits in your hands. Whenever people violate order, they incur grave consequences.  1 Chron. 15:13 says, For because you did not do it the first time, the Lord our God broke out against us, because we did not consult Him about the proper order \(NKJV\). In this scripture, they were doing a good thing but someone lost his life because he violated the order of how it ought to be done. It is not enough to know what to do, you must find out how to do it and the proper order that governs doing it. You can never get favour and approval in a place or with a person that you violate the laid down order. Following laid down order is one of the fastest ways to secure favour with a person or group.)
/E (There is proper order in communication lines in an organization. There is due order in business communication and it is different from informal conversation. There is a right order in relating with the opposite gender, There is also due order in ministry as regards relating with the people and resources God commits in your hands. Whenever people violate order, they incur grave consequences.  1 Chron. 15:13 says, For because you did not do it the first time, the Lord our God broke out against us, because we did not consult Him about the proper order \(NKJV\). In this scripture, they were doing a good thing but someone lost his life because he violated the order of how it ought to be done. It is not enough to know what to do, you must find out how to do it and the proper order that governs doing it. You can never get favour and approval in a place or with a person that you violate the laid down order. Following laid down order is one of the fastest ways to secure favour with a person or group.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [2]
>>
