1026 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Though it may not be a conventional knowledge, a secret strategy that every great and visionary person should engage is the Wisdom of Solitude - being alone and going alone when occasion demands. Have you noticed that most of the activities that involve the highest level of personal productivity need a level of solitude for appropriate focus? Prayer, studying, practising a skill, meditating, writing and a host of other exercises that are important for life progress, need one to be alone to do them effectively. Even when such activities are to be done publicly with others, it is how well each individual have mastered them privately that determines how well they do them  publicly.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
