1054 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Jesus set the precedence of valuing the secret place for all believers. Thus, after He started ministry, he periodically withdrew into the secret place until the final moments in Gethsemane where He was alone with God to prepare for the cross \(Matt 26: 36 - 38\). In fact, Jesus counted periodic withdrawal into solitude so important that he had to school His disciples in the Art and Wisdom of Solitude. In Luke 9:10-11, Then the apostles returned, they reported to Jesus what they had done. Then he took them with him and they withdrew by themselves to a town called Bethsaida, but the crowds learned about it and followed him. Luke 5:16 says, But Jesus often withdrew to the wilderness for prayer. Also in John 6:15-16, Jesus, knowing that they intended to come and make him king by force, withdrew again to a mountain by himself. Jesus constantly practised the Wisdom of Solitude and so should you.)
/E (Jesus set the precedence of valuing the secret place for all believers. Thus, after He started ministry, he periodically withdrew into the secret place until the final moments in Gethsemane where He was alone with God to prepare for the cross \(Matt 26: 36 - 38\). In fact, Jesus counted periodic withdrawal into solitude so important that he had to school His disciples in the Art and Wisdom of Solitude. In Luke 9:10-11, Then the apostles returned, they reported to Jesus what they had done. Then he took them with him and they withdrew by themselves to a town called Bethsaida, but the crowds learned about it and followed him. Luke 5:16 says, But Jesus often withdrew to the wilderness for prayer. Also in John 6:15-16, Jesus, knowing that they intended to come and make him king by force, withdrew again to a mountain by himself. Jesus constantly practised the Wisdom of Solitude and so should you.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [2]
>>
