/S /H1
/T (3. Build a Financial System: An employee cannot transfer their employed job to their progeny but they can transfer ownership of business they built. This shows us that it is only what you build that you ever really own. It is great wisdom to build a business. While it is not everyone that might have the skill and training to succeed as an entrepreneur, some will succeed as intrapreneurs. However it is most important that everyone owns a financial system that you can pass over as a legacy. This could be a business, an investment or an income generating asset. Prov. 27: 24 says develop your business first before building your house \(NLT\).)
/E (3. Build a Financial System: An employee cannot transfer their employed job to their progeny but they can transfer ownership of business they built. This shows us that it is only what you build that you ever really own. It is great wisdom to build a business. While it is not everyone that might have the skill and training to succeed as an entrepreneur, some will succeed as intrapreneurs. However it is most important that everyone owns a financial system that you can pass over as a legacy. This could be a business, an investment or an income generating asset. Prov. 27: 24 says develop your business first before building your house \(NLT\).)
