/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (6. Build a House: it is a blessing to own your home. Do not be comfortable as a tenant, no matter how nice your landlord or house-agent is. The amount some people spend on a rented apartment and luxury is alarming when they do not have a land or home to their own name anywhere. Build houses to rent to others and own your own home. The earlier you build a house, the better.)
