1076 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (7. Build a Platform: There should be a platform where you dispense value to the world. A platform is a meeting point between you and people for the purpose of exchange of value. Do not just work for the sake of earning a livelihood all through life. Make sure you build a platform for dispensing your inherent values to people. Most times, your platform is the stream and the determinant of your rewards in life. It could be physical or virtual, but make sure there is a platform that you have built to deliver and dispense your inherent giftings to the world. A platform could be a ministry, business, charity organisation, etc. It is very good and profitable to join an existing platform. However, it is also powerful to create your own platform, even if it is as a subset or as a complementary set to the platform you joined. In other words, it is okay to join an existing system, but the platform must afford you the opportunity to dispense your individual contribution in a way that you are also positioned for reward. In some cases, it is possible and wise to create a platform that runs uniquely, uncompetitively and simultaneously with the platform you are part of.)
/E (7. Build a Platform: There should be a platform where you dispense value to the world. A platform is a meeting point between you and people for the purpose of exchange of value. Do not just work for the sake of earning a livelihood all through life. Make sure you build a platform for dispensing your inherent values to people. Most times, your platform is the stream and the determinant of your rewards in life. It could be physical or virtual, but make sure there is a platform that you have built to deliver and dispense your inherent giftings to the world. A platform could be a ministry, business, charity organisation, etc. It is very good and profitable to join an existing platform. However, it is also powerful to create your own platform, even if it is as a subset or as a complementary set to the platform you joined. In other words, it is okay to join an existing system, but the platform must afford you the opportunity to dispense your individual contribution in a way that you are also positioned for reward. In some cases, it is possible and wise to create a platform that runs uniquely, uncompetitively and simultaneously with the platform you are part of.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1077 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (8. Build wealth: There is a difference between making money and building wealth. To build wealth, you must carefully amalgamate a portfolio of multiple streams of income for consistent inflow and growth of wealth. Wealth building demands that there are financial streams that bring consistent cash flow to you so that you are never short of money to meet your immediate expenditure. At the same time they are streams that are able to do capital projects so that you can advance financially through targeted gains. )
/E (8. Build wealth: There is a difference between making money and building wealth. To build wealth, you must carefully amalgamate a portfolio of multiple streams of income for consistent inflow and growth of wealth. Wealth building demands that there are financial streams that bring consistent cash flow to you so that you are never short of money to meet your immediate expenditure. At the same time they are streams that are able to do capital projects so that you can advance financially through targeted gains. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
