/ActualText (God is neither renting nor leasing heaven; He is Owner and He wants you to be an owner as well. Ps 24:1-2 declares the earth is the Lord's, and everything in it, the world, and all who live in it; for he founded it upon the seas and established it upon the waters. God confidently declares in Ps 50:10-12, Every beast of the forest is mine, and the cattle upon a thousand hills. I know all the fowls of the mountains: )
