1146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In basic examples, a person who cannot afford a home of his own and is putting up with someone is not yet independent; a person who needs other people or even the government to support before they can feed is not independent. It is important to take up responsibility and pursue independence and freedom because our highest potential, most times, manifests when we learn to stand without human crutches.)
/E (In basic examples, a person who cannot afford a home of his own and is putting up with someone is not yet independent; a person who needs other people or even the government to support before they can feed is not independent. It is important to take up responsibility and pursue independence and freedom because our highest potential, most times, manifests when we learn to stand without human crutches.)
/Pg 58 0 R
/K [2]
>>
