1151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (There are many forms of dependence but they start mostly with financial or emotional dependence. Financial dependence is when you do not have the means of resources to meet your own needs and always have to fall back on someone else. This robs people of the freedom of self-determination and decision. The highest gift God gave man is self-will and lack of independence robs one of this. Thus, pursuing financial independence will go a long way in positioning you to fulfil your destiny. Financial independence is the state of having systems in place that generate income whether you are actively involved or not, so that your time is free to do other things for the rest of your life. It comes as a result of having consistent residual and passive income that is above your total expenditure, whose cash flow continues for the rest of your life whether you continue to work or not. It is also in the spirit of independence that one must seek not to be totally dependent on a job or boss for a lifetime. )
/E (There are many forms of dependence but they start mostly with financial or emotional dependence. Financial dependence is when you do not have the means of resources to meet your own needs and always have to fall back on someone else. This robs people of the freedom of self-determination and decision. The highest gift God gave man is self-will and lack of independence robs one of this. Thus, pursuing financial independence will go a long way in positioning you to fulfil your destiny. Financial independence is the state of having systems in place that generate income whether you are actively involved or not, so that your time is free to do other things for the rest of your life. It comes as a result of having consistent residual and passive income that is above your total expenditure, whose cash flow continues for the rest of your life whether you continue to work or not. It is also in the spirit of independence that one must seek not to be totally dependent on a job or boss for a lifetime. )
/Pg 59 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Emotional dependence is the inability to survive and thrive without the involvement of a particular person, system or thing in your life. )
/E (Emotional dependence is the inability to survive and thrive without the involvement of a particular person, system or thing in your life. )
/Pg 59 0 R
/K [2]
>>
