1166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (affects the chances of growth. Fishes grow in water and die on land. A lion reigns supreme in the jungle and dies in water. An eagle dominates in the sky but struggles in a cage. You do not stand an equal chance of thriving in all environments.  Your environment which describes the culture, practices, location, facilities, resources, organisation and people around you, determines your growth. It is wise to change environment if where you are is not supportive of growth.)
/E (affects the chances of growth. Fishes grow in water and die on land. A lion reigns supreme in the jungle and dies in water. An eagle dominates in the sky but struggles in a cage. You do not stand an equal chance of thriving in all environments.  Your environment which describes the culture, practices, location, facilities, resources, organisation and people around you, determines your growth. It is wise to change environment if where you are is not supportive of growth.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [0]
