1168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Another important growth system is your routines. Routines are things you do consistently and periodically that sharpen the outcome of your life. There are routines that produce growth and routines that prevents growth. When you see a child daily, you do not notice he/she is growing. However, after a while, growth is noticeable on sight. Routines are very powerful system for growth A beginner in learning a skill becomes a master by the routine of daily rehearsal, practice and workouts. Growth produced by routines may be unnoticeable at first as daily routines seem not to be making much difference until one day when remarkable growth becomes obvious. Daily routines of growth include daily extensive time of prayer, solitary )
/E (Another important growth system is your routines. Routines are things you do consistently and periodically that sharpen the outcome of your life. There are routines that produce growth and routines that prevents growth. When you see a child daily, you do not notice he/she is growing. However, after a while, growth is noticeable on sight. Routines are very powerful system for growth A beginner in learning a skill becomes a master by the routine of daily rehearsal, practice and workouts. Growth produced by routines may be unnoticeable at first as daily routines seem not to be making much difference until one day when remarkable growth becomes obvious. Daily routines of growth include daily extensive time of prayer, solitary )
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [2]
