/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Therefore, the wisdom of growth entails knowing what to order aright in your life, environment, attitudes, routines and systems that growth becomes a spontaneous effect of your daily life. Success comes on its own as the system for growth is put in place.)
/E (Therefore, the wisdom of growth entails knowing what to order aright in your life, environment, attitudes, routines and systems that growth becomes a spontaneous effect of your daily life. Success comes on its own as the system for growth is put in place.)
