1173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Growth must be holistic; growing in an aspect of life and leaving out another produces a handicapped Growth must be intentional and strategic for it to be beneficial. The first step in growing sustainably is to understand what holistic growth entails because it is very possible to grow in an area of life and not grow in another. A vital understanding in growth is to know the vital areas of life-growth. Growing in an area of life and not growing in another produces an haphazard life-structure that eventually results in life-malfunction and sometimes, life-collapse.)
/E (Growth must be holistic; growing in an aspect of life and leaving out another produces a handicapped Growth must be intentional and strategic for it to be beneficial. The first step in growing sustainably is to understand what holistic growth entails because it is very possible to grow in an area of life and not grow in another. A vital understanding in growth is to know the vital areas of life-growth. Growing in an area of life and not growing in another produces an haphazard life-structure that eventually results in life-malfunction and sometimes, life-collapse.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [2]
