1190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Numbers 23: 19 says, God is not a man, so he does not lie. He is not human, so he does not change his mind . . . .  Active proponents of this scripture have rightfully emphasised the point that it is unlike God to change. Many have missed the salient point that this scripture hereby acknowledges, that it is absolutely normal for man to change. In fact, never changing would be abnormal for a man, because then, he would be laying claim to being God. I guess you are not GOD, therefore, you need to be open to change.)
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
