/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (people asked Jesus, "What must we do to do the works God requires?" and Jesus answered, "The work of God is this: to believe in the one he has sent." So, even believing is work. Faith is spiritual work. Do not allow anyone to make you think you are wasting time or lazying away praying, believing and putting spiritual efforts. However, spiritual work without physical and mental work will never produce results. Conversely, physical and mental work without spiritual work is a recipe for a life of struggles.)
