1230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One of the wisest decisions in life is the decision to live for impact. There is a difference between accomplishment and impact. Accomplishments are the additions you make for yourself. Impact is the addition you make to others. An accomplished person may not be impactful, but it is possible to be both accomplished and impactful. If you ever have to choose between being accomplished and being impactful, choose both!)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Positive impact is one's strength to cause positive effect or change in the lives of others. Impact is one's ability to modify people's situation, lifestyle and experience through concentrated actions, relationships and conversations with them. The end-point of impact is to inspire change from the present to a more desirable future for people. It involves giving your time, resources, ability, money and sometimes, your entire self and life so that others can have a better life.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
