1239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In addition to evangelism, the following are wisdom keys for impact: 1. Have a platform where you are raising and building up people and making them better. This is not limited to spiritual platforms but also includes secular platforms where you add value to people and make them better. The platform may be founded by you or by someone else while you join to make an impact.)
/E (In addition to evangelism, the following are wisdom keys for impact: 1. Have a platform where you are raising and building up people and making them better. This is not limited to spiritual platforms but also includes secular platforms where you add value to people and make them better. The platform may be founded by you or by someone else while you join to make an impact.)
/Pg 75 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
