1249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A seed is anything that carries the ability to produce after its kind. A seed is a substance, action, circumstance or thing that carries the potential to produce a predetermined bigger reality with time. In Genesis 1:11 Then God said, "Let the land burst forth with every sort of grass and seed-bearing plant. And let there be trees that grow seed-bearing fruit. The seeds will then produce the kinds of plants and trees from which they came. The land was filled seed-bearing plants and trees, and their seeds produced plants and trees of like kind. And God saw that it was good. Every biological life carries in itself a seed which is the power for continuity and reproduction. Similarly, everything in life has a seed which brought it into being.)
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The wisdom of seed is one of the most powerful keys in life. It is the guiding principle for knowing what to do to produce a desired result. The wisdom of the seed is that for whatever you want to see in life, there is something to do to trigger it. This wisdom also advises us on what not to do if we do not want to reap certain kinds of harvest. )
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
