1253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Matt 7:12 says, therefore all things whatsoever ye would that men should do to you, do ye even so to them: for this is the law and the prophets. The entire Bible is premised on the Principle of the Seed.)
/E (Matt 7:12 says, therefore all things whatsoever ye would that men should do to you, do ye even so to them: for this is the law and the prophets. The entire Bible is premised on the Principle of the Seed.)
/Pg 77 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (It is quite important to know that all seeds do not produce the same harvest. There is a seed for every outcome. In other words, the seed to plant for a good marriage may not be the same to plant for a successful academics or career, The seed for financial prosperity may also be different from the seed of spiritual prosperity. Wisdom is knowing the right seed for your desired result in each area of your life and taking the diligence and sacrifice to plant and nurture that seed.)
/E (It is quite important to know that all seeds do not produce the same harvest. There is a seed for every outcome. In other words, the seed to plant for a good marriage may not be the same to plant for a successful academics or career, The seed for financial prosperity may also be different from the seed of spiritual prosperity. Wisdom is knowing the right seed for your desired result in each area of your life and taking the diligence and sacrifice to plant and nurture that seed.)
/Pg 77 0 R
/K [1]
>>
