/Pg 82 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (You are not too young to be rich neither are you too old. The pursuit of wealth is not a male task and the environment or country of your residence is not a deterrent. Learn the spiritual and physical laws that you need to apply and build wealth. Some of these spiritual laws include giving, positive mental orientation towards wealth, meditation on wealth scriptures, partnering with God, His house and His grace through His vessels. Physical laws include skill and value creation, productivity and diligence, sales and transaction, investment and entrepreneurship and many other laws.)
/E (You are not too young to be rich neither are you too old. The pursuit of wealth is not a male task and the environment or country of your residence is not a deterrent. Learn the spiritual and physical laws that you need to apply and build wealth. Some of these spiritual laws include giving, positive mental orientation towards wealth, meditation on wealth scriptures, partnering with God, His house and His grace through His vessels. Physical laws include skill and value creation, productivity and diligence, sales and transaction, investment and entrepreneurship and many other laws.)
/Pg 82 0 R
/K [0]
>>
