1302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (A stingy man is cursed and hated by his friends.  The law of giving is a universal law and works for everyone regardless of race, religion or gender. The Wisdom of giving is understanding the power of living the giving life and being intentional about giving. Do not just give sympathetically when the need arises or when you feel you have excess, Giving should be an intentional, conscious and habitual act, done from a standpoint of understanding how it works. Giving should be an  essential part of your life as breathing is. Make sure there is a percentage of your income that is given to God, to His work and to help people. Start from the little you have and as the blessings of giving make more resources come to you, the amount you give also increases.)
/E (A stingy man is cursed and hated by his friends.  The law of giving is a universal law and works for everyone regardless of race, religion or gender. The Wisdom of giving is understanding the power of living the giving life and being intentional about giving. Do not just give sympathetically when the need arises or when you feel you have excess, Giving should be an intentional, conscious and habitual act, done from a standpoint of understanding how it works. Giving should be an  essential part of your life as breathing is. Make sure there is a percentage of your income that is given to God, to His work and to help people. Start from the little you have and as the blessings of giving make more resources come to you, the amount you give also increases.)
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [0]
