<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (A person can be anointed with the Spirit of Wisdom, manifesting as skills and expertise in a particular field. Thus, believers need to partner with the Holy Spirit so that they become extremely skillful at their crafts, this is the way the world will be shown the supremacy of God. We must make it a point of duty to be at the peak of performance in all our endeavours. Christianity is not a call to secular mediocrity; it is a call to skill. Exchange of skilled value is what translates to financial return in the marketplace. Meaning, a person may be spiritually sound but is struggling financially because there is no transactable skill he/she has.)
/E (A person can be anointed with the Spirit of Wisdom, manifesting as skills and expertise in a particular field. Thus, believers need to partner with the Holy Spirit so that they become extremely skillful at their crafts, this is the way the world will be shown the supremacy of God. We must make it a point of duty to be at the peak of performance in all our endeavours. Christianity is not a call to secular mediocrity; it is a call to skill. Exchange of skilled value is what translates to financial return in the marketplace. Meaning, a person may be spiritually sound but is struggling financially because there is no transactable skill he/she has.)
/Pg 89 0 R
