1338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (There is a general scope of learning about life and living, which is naturally acquired as one grows up into maturation. And there are also specific disciplines across various spheres of influence that one can be subjected to, for learning unto mastery and professionalism. These domains include; economics, politics, medicine, technology, law, art, industrialization, etc. And the vehicle of learning that drives a person into being a master in these domains is academic education. The misconception about "school being scam" should be outrightly cleared off. A believer should not be clouded by the foolish religiosity of seeing schooling as unnecessary and irrelevant. School is a secular institution that helps to reproduce a naive mind into a mastermind in a specific course. Hence, a wise believer is one who is not just spiritually advancing, but excellently doing well in his field of study or discipline.)
/E (There is a general scope of learning about life and living, which is naturally acquired as one grows up into maturation. And there are also specific disciplines across various spheres of influence that one can be subjected to, for learning unto mastery and professionalism. These domains include; economics, politics, medicine, technology, law, art, industrialization, etc. And the vehicle of learning that drives a person into being a master in these domains is academic education. The misconception about "school being scam" should be outrightly cleared off. A believer should not be clouded by the foolish religiosity of seeing schooling as unnecessary and irrelevant. School is a secular institution that helps to reproduce a naive mind into a mastermind in a specific course. Hence, a wise believer is one who is not just spiritually advancing, but excellently doing well in his field of study or discipline.)
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [1]
>>
