1354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Of course, this is not to say that big events are not valuable. The truth is that such events are of great use when there is a platform that runs consistently which the event will feed, and into which the proceeds from the big event will be harvested. Everyone who has ever built a working platform - business, ministry or charity, knows that many times, the proceeds of growth from a mega event, no matter how minimal could be worthwhile as long as it adds value to an existing consistent platform one is building. It is wise not to measure success merely by the execution of a mega project but by its addition spiritually, numerically, intellectually or otherwise to the existing platform. Consistency allows growth to be measurable. James 1:25 says but he who looks into the perfect law of liberty AND CONTINUES IN IT, and is not a forgetful hearer but a doer of the work, this one will be blessed in what he does \(NKJV\). Even beneficial spiritual, intellectual and character disciplines only thrive on the basis of consistency. An emergency approach to such disciplines will not give the desired results. There are people who declare unreasonably long days of marathon fasting and prayers because they have problems, not )
