1358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (1 Timothy 4:16 says, Take heed unto thyself, and unto the doctrine; continue in them: for in doing this thou shalt both save thyself, and them that hear thee. It is in consistency and continuing to do the right things that you bring profit to yourself and people around you. The blessedness of any good practice is the consistency of doing it. Consistency ascertains progress and results. It is very important to factor consistency in our plans. Sometimes, it is wise not to initiate things until you are sure you can sustain it consistently, Visions die without consistency, even brilliant performances result in failure without consistency. Consistency birth results and makes one outstanding. Whatever beneficial thing you are doing, factor consistency into the plan.)
/E (1 Timothy 4:16 says, Take heed unto thyself, and unto the doctrine; continue in them: for in doing this thou shalt both save thyself, and them that hear thee. It is in consistency and continuing to do the right things that you bring profit to yourself and people around you. The blessedness of any good practice is the consistency of doing it. Consistency ascertains progress and results. It is very important to factor consistency in our plans. Sometimes, it is wise not to initiate things until you are sure you can sustain it consistently, Visions die without consistency, even brilliant performances result in failure without consistency. Consistency birth results and makes one outstanding. Whatever beneficial thing you are doing, factor consistency into the plan.)
