/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Humility is an essential virtue of character and wisdom in a Christian. One ultimate measure of Christlikeness in a person is the level of humility. Matt 11: 28 - 29 says, Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest. Take my yoke upon you and learn from me, for I am gentle and humble in heart, and you will find rest for your souls. For my yoke is easy and my burden is light. Among many things to learn from Jesus Christ is His kind of humility.)
