/T (The first level of honour should be unto God. Prov. 3:9-10 records, "Honour the LORD with thy substance, And with the firstfruits of all thine increase: So shall thy barns be filled with plenty, And thy presses shall burst out with new wine." We must honour God with all our heart and life. Honouring the Lord involves living a life that pleases him in all )
