/T (While we are to be loving and friendly to everyone, know today that you cannot give everyone access to yourself. The people you listen to and relate with are the greatest determinant of who you are becoming in life. This includes the church you attend, the school you go to, the colleagues you work with, the books you read, the movies you watch, the people you follow on social media. The law of association is all encompassing.)
