1435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Jesus wanted to choose the twelve people that would be closest to Him in His earthly walk and spent an entire night praying. This shows us that we must be prayerful and spiritually sensitive in deciding who we allow to cross from one level of relationship to another with us. There are different levels of relationships in a person's life. There are strangers, acquaintances, friends and family, inner circles and confidants. Do not give people a place they do not belong with you. The rules of relating with people at these levels are different. You have to pray before allowing people into certain levels of your life space.)
/E (Jesus wanted to choose the twelve people that would be closest to Him in His earthly walk and spent an entire night praying. This shows us that we must be prayerful and spiritually sensitive in deciding who we allow to cross from one level of relationship to another with us. There are different levels of relationships in a person's life. There are strangers, acquaintances, friends and family, inner circles and confidants. Do not give people a place they do not belong with you. The rules of relating with people at these levels are different. You have to pray before allowing people into certain levels of your life space.)
