1483 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (back the same route he went. He delivered both the public message and the private instruction to everyone. It was the details of the private instruction that the older prophet that masterminded his death used to destroy him. So, this implies that biological age or cultural respect should not be the primary reason why you should give people the details of your destiny and access to counsel you, but rather, you should be led by the Spirit of God and be discerning by the Spirit of Wisdom to know who deserves and who does not deserve to know things about you. It is not everyone that has the right counsel for your specific situation. Thus, you have to discern through wisdom and prayer who God wants you to talk to in a particular situation.)
/E (back the same route he went. He delivered both the public message and the private instruction to everyone. It was the details of the private instruction that the older prophet that masterminded his death used to destroy him. So, this implies that biological age or cultural respect should not be the primary reason why you should give people the details of your destiny and access to counsel you, but rather, you should be led by the Spirit of God and be discerning by the Spirit of Wisdom to know who deserves and who does not deserve to know things about you. It is not everyone that has the right counsel for your specific situation. Thus, you have to discern through wisdom and prayer who God wants you to talk to in a particular situation.)
/Pg 121 0 R
