1484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The Lord Jesus Christ always knew what about Him was for private keep and for public consumption. So in several places in the Bible, he would do or say things, even good things, and would tell his disciple to make sure no one knows about it. In some cases, he will take the three most trusted out of all his disciples and allow only them to see or hear certain things about him. There are many other occasions in the Bible where Jesus would heal privately and instruct the healed not to go around telling everyone what he has done. He did this to teach them a powerful lesson of being discreet about what God was doing in their lives per season. While it is good to share testimonies of God's goodness, it is wise to discern what to share and what to keep to yourself. It is not every breakthrough you have that is meant for the social media.)
/E (The Lord Jesus Christ always knew what about Him was for private keep and for public consumption. So in several places in the Bible, he would do or say things, even good things, and would tell his disciple to make sure no one knows about it. In some cases, he will take the three most trusted out of all his disciples and allow only them to see or hear certain things about him. There are many other occasions in the Bible where Jesus would heal privately and instruct the healed not to go around telling everyone what he has done. He did this to teach them a powerful lesson of being discreet about what God was doing in their lives per season. While it is good to share testimonies of God's goodness, it is wise to discern what to share and what to keep to yourself. It is not every breakthrough you have that is meant for the social media.)
/Pg 121 0 R
/K [1]
>>
