1510 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (God is ever committed to guiding your destiny into fulfilment, but it is your responsibility to yield as He moves you to speak and to be silent. This is one of the competitive advantages that believers have over the unbelievers, we have the Holy Spirit to guide us to know what to say, how to say it and when to say it. So, we can speak ourselves into favour, promotion, prosperity, and all manners of help, just because we are right in time with our utterances. What is the wisest way to engage the wisdom of utterance? Lean on the Holy Spirit to know what to say, when to say it and how to say it and even what not to say when dealing with men. Then when dealing with situations, demonic forces, powers of darkness and enemies, just put the word of God in your mouth and boldly decree it to the situation.)
/E (God is ever committed to guiding your destiny into fulfilment, but it is your responsibility to yield as He moves you to speak and to be silent. This is one of the competitive advantages that believers have over the unbelievers, we have the Holy Spirit to guide us to know what to say, how to say it and when to say it. So, we can speak ourselves into favour, promotion, prosperity, and all manners of help, just because we are right in time with our utterances. What is the wisest way to engage the wisdom of utterance? Lean on the Holy Spirit to know what to say, when to say it and how to say it and even what not to say when dealing with men. Then when dealing with situations, demonic forces, powers of darkness and enemies, just put the word of God in your mouth and boldly decree it to the situation.)
