/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Love is an eternal, life-giving, life-changing power. The Wisdom of Love starts with loving God, people, oneself and it extends to loving what you do and loving life. You should be a walking ball-fire radiating love. The wisdom of love goes beyond loving people to loving things. Therefore, pour your love and passion into your life assignment and work. Love is the seed for impact and greatness. You cannot impact positively a person or system you do not love. You cannot become great in what you do not love.)
/E (Love is an eternal, life-giving, life-changing power. The Wisdom of Love starts with loving God, people, oneself and it extends to loving what you do and loving life. You should be a walking ball-fire radiating love. The wisdom of love goes beyond loving people to loving things. Therefore, pour your love and passion into your life assignment and work. Love is the seed for impact and greatness. You cannot impact positively a person or system you do not love. You cannot become great in what you do not love.)
/Pg 130 0 R
/K [2]
>>
