/T (There are heights in life attainment that one cannot get to unless love is involved. This is the error of supporting leaders who kill, steal and cheat to get into leadership position. They love position not people so they cannot put people first when they get to the place of leadership. It is not loving politics or being good at politics that makes great leaders; it is loving people because what you love you are wise in relating with.)
