/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (There are many diligent and fervid labourers in various spheres in the world today; building their lives, careers, businesses, ministries, industries, conglomerates; according to an idea or a plan they have devised in their minds; while working with the sure principles of life that procure success and greatness. However, not so many of these folks really amount to the weight of greatness they envisaged in their mind. Passion, diligence, consistency, followership, persistency, resilience, charisma, finesse, intelligence, skills; these and more are the effective keys that unlock greatness, and open one up to a life of beauty and splendour. However, all these keys without the master key of prayer will not produce the accurate results that match up with the effort invested and the work done; this then result in pain, disappointment and frustration.)
