/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (hands? What assignment has God given to you? What vision has God revealed in your heart? What career has God given you as an ambition? What business idea has God ideated in your mind? What ministry has God ordained you for? PRAY! It is foolish to receive the blueprint of one's destiny from God and then start running with it by human philosophies and principles. The God who gave the architectural plan is also interested in the building process. And this is by prayer. "O Lord, I know that the way of man is not in himself: it is not in man that walketh to direct his steps." \(Jer. 10:23\) When God shows the way, He is keenly interested in leading the way, and guiding one's feet step by step. A wise man understands that "there is a way that seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof are the ways of death. \(Prov. 16:25\) So, he depends on God completely to order his steps and to dictate his moves. And this is as he prays. Prayer is an enforcer by which one enforces the promises of God over one's life into reality. Prayer is also a means by which one tenders one's petitions before God, supplicating for His provisions in alignment with His Will for one's life.)
/E (hands? What assignment has God given to you? What vision has God revealed in your heart? What career has God given you as an ambition? What business idea has God ideated in your mind? What ministry has God ordained you for? PRAY! It is foolish to receive the blueprint of one's destiny from God and then start running with it by human philosophies and principles. The God who gave the architectural plan is also interested in the building process. And this is by prayer. "O Lord, I know that the way of man is not in himself: it is not in man that walketh to direct his steps." \(Jer. 10:23\) When God shows the way, He is keenly interested in leading the way, and guiding one's feet step by step. A wise man understands that "there is a way that seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof are the ways of death. \(Prov. 16:25\) So, he depends on God completely to order his steps and to dictate his moves. And this is as he prays. Prayer is an enforcer by which one enforces the promises of God over one's life into reality. Prayer is also a means by which one tenders one's petitions before God, supplicating for His provisions in alignment with His Will for one's life.)
