/T (At times, it is not merely the absence of doing the right things in the natural - all the things which have been largely portrayed in this book - that is responsible for the presence of certain life limitations. Many times, it is because there is something in the spiritual realm that needs to be engaged. The story of Job is a classic example of the hold the spiritual has over the physical. Job was successful, having all going well at a moment and the next moment, he was down to ashes. All this did not happen because he did anything differently in the natural realm but because a negotiation happened concerning him in the spiritual which he was even oblivion to.)
