/T (The first place where the word "eternity" was mentioned In the Bible \(KJV\) is in Isaiah 57:15a "For thus saith the high and lofty One that inhabiteth eternity, whose name is Holy; I dwell in the high and holy place" Herein, we understand that God lives and inhabits himself in eternity. What then is eternity? Eternity is a spiritual reality of a realm and existence that is beyond time. )
