/T (In the world today, there are many religions and sects who in one way or the other believe that God is the object of their worship. They claim to be servants and followers of God, but outside of the lordship of Jesus. It's so unfortunate to see men labour religiously in good deeds and morality, but only unto futility and vanity. Because there are not many ways, but only one way to God, and that's through Jesus Christ. Acts 4:12 "There is salvation in no one else, for there is no other name under heaven given among men by which we must be saved.")
