1673 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (According to scriptures, Wisdom is the most important thing to get to ascertain a life of meaning, success and fulfilment. However, Wisdom is not unilateral but multifaceted and dynamic. Meaning that a person can be wise in an area of life and absolutely unwise in another. Furthermore, a person can be wise today and act with astounding foolishness tomorrow. Thus, knowing and practising wisdom everyday of life and in every area of life should not be left to chance. The 31 Wisdom Keys gives profound wisdom capsules for each day and spreads wisdom tentacles across all areas of life. This book will challenge you to live with the deliberate consciousness of applying wisdom in every area of your existence. )
/Pg 153 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
