1677 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (He is the founder of several initiatives both within the church and the workplace, such as The Wisdom Institute of Leadership and Ministry for training and equipping church leaders, ENABLED Multiconcept for business and professional leadership development and consultancy, as well as several other platforms for Bible-based Teaching Ministry. He has a bachelor's degree in chemical engineering and a master's degree in engineering management from Ahmadu Bello University, Nigeria. He is married to Deborah OluwaNifemi and they are blessed with children. )
/Pg 153 0 R
/K [4]
